stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> DRAFT : OP-01 create\nvalid interval + resource exists

    state "Draft" as DRAFT
    state "Pending approval" as PENDING_APPROVAL
    state "Confirmed" as CONFIRMED
    state "Rejected" as REJECTED
    state "Cancelled" as CANCELLED
    state "Expired" as EXPIRED

    DRAFT --> CONFIRMED : OP-03 confirm\nstandard + active + future start + no overlap
    DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL : OP-03 request approval\nrequiresApproval + active + future start

    PENDING_APPROVAL --> CONFIRMED : OP-05 approve\nbefore reviewDeadline + no overlap
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : OP-06 reject
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> EXPIRED : OP-07 expire\nnow >= reviewDeadline OR now >= start

    DRAFT --> CANCELLED : OP-04 cancel\nbefore start
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED : OP-04 cancel\nbefore start
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : OP-04 cancel\nbefore start

    CONFIRMED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]

    note right of DRAFT
        Intent recorded.
        Vehicle is not locked.
    end note

    note right of PENDING_APPROVAL
        Soft lock on the slot.
        Blocks availability (BR-02).
        Awaiting approver decision.
    end note

    note right of CONFIRMED
        Binding allocation.
        Blocks overlapping availability (BR-02).
    end note
